        "faq1": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I’ve already tried probiotics. How is this different?",
            "content": "<p>Probiotics add more bacteria to the gut. If the problem is bacteria building up in the wrong place, adding more can make bloating worse. This formula works the other way around: it targets the biofilm bacteria hide behind and supports the motility that sweeps them out, so your gut can rebalance on its own.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq2": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I’ve already tried Rifaximin. Why would this work when that didn’t?",
            "content": "<p>We can’t compare a dietary supplement to a prescription medication, and you should always talk to your doctor about your treatment. What we can say is that this formula takes a different, botanical approach: it pairs ingredients studied for disrupting biofilm with ginger to support gut motility, the part that helps keep things from coming back.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq3": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "My main issue is urgency, running to the bathroom after eating. Will this help?",
            "content": "<p>Many of our customers bought it for exactly that. The formula is designed to support healthy motility and digestive comfort, which can help with occasional urgency and cramping.* Results vary from person to person, which is why every order is covered by our 90-day guarantee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq4": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I take this forever, or is it a 90-day protocol?",
            "content": "<p>Most people follow it as a 90-day protocol, which is why the 3- and 6-bottle bundles are the most popular. After that, many customers keep a bottle on hand for maintenance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq5": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why won’t this just come back like everything else I’ve tried?",
            "content": "<p>Most approaches only deal with the bacteria and ignore why they built up in the first place. This formula also supports the gut’s natural cleaning wave (motility), which helps keep things moving the way they should.*</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq6": {
          "type": "collapsible",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is there a guarantee?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Try it for up to 90 days. If you don’t love your results, contact our team for a 100% refund, even if the bottles are empty.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
